msgstr "Wiki 编辑指南"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:8
#: 340d6bfe5e244b1bbd21ce1dcc6d8aac
msgid ""
"All members of the ArduPilot community are encouraged to contribute to the "
"wiki,  including creating new pages, updating older ones and fixing broken "
"links and spelling errors."
msgstr "欢迎所有 ArduPilot 社区成员贡献 wiki，包括创建新页面、更新旧页面以及修复失效链接和拼写错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:22
#: b5f86f6b23824076a3b3289a2448fa64
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:24
#: 735d8cdf841b4f36aa94ca30e5f55e7f
msgid ""
"All content on this wiki is licensed under the terms of the `Creative "
"Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported "
"<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/>`__."
msgstr ""
"本 wiki 的所有内容均遵循 `Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported "
"<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/>`__ 的许可条款。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:28
#: e42b5ca62cc249749cc3f25c07f8358e
msgid ""
"Only post content that you have the legal right to make available under the "
"`CC BY-SA 3.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/>`__ license. "
"If you do use images or content that belongs to others, seek permission for "
"re-use and clearly state their origin and terms for re-use."
msgstr ""
"仅发布您有权在 `CC BY-SA 3.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/>`__ "
"许可下提供的内容。如使用他人的图片或内容，请获得重用许可并清楚注明来源和重用条款。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:34
#: c3995abfcf09466ea8fc4d7184f496a6
msgid "Translating wiki pages"
msgstr "翻译 wiki 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:36
#: 50ce29d0b4cc4d6ba185445ed8a36acb
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Translation is currently not supported, but it is possible to view "
"ArduPilot.org in other languages through services such as `Google Translate "
"<https://translate.google.com/translate?hl=&sl=en&tl=es&u=https%3A%2F%2Fardupilot.org%2F>`__."
msgstr ""
"目前不支持翻译，但可通过 `Google 翻译 "
"<https://translate.google.com/translate?hl=&sl=en&tl=es&u=https%3A%2F%2Fardupilot.org%2F>`__"
" 等服务以其他语言查看 ArduPilot.org。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:40
#: f9e62b47f9064949830732a33e50289c
msgid "FAQ - Why are my changes not published?"
msgstr "常见问题 - 为何我的修改未发布？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki_editing_guide.rst:42
#: 74c6493f0e164224b6a2c00ef316b943
msgid ""
"All changes to the wiki are `reviewed "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/pulls>`__ by the wiki "
"\"maintainers\" to help reduce the chance of misleading or incorrect "
"information being posted.  Feel free to post comments in the PullRequest "
"and/or attend the :ref:`weekly dev meeting <dev:ardupilot-discord-server>` "
"to escalate getting your changes submitted."
msgstr ""
"所有 wiki 变更均由 wiki「维护者」 `审查 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/pulls>`__，以减少错误或误导性信息的发布。欢迎在 "
"Pull Request 中发表评论，也可参加 :ref:`每周开发者会议 <dev:ardupilot-discord-server>` "
"以推进您的变更提交。"
